      "title": "It was never a box（第4話）",
      "headline": "IT WAS NEVER A BOX",
      "text": "It was never a box. In Hesiod's poem, from around 700 BC, Pandora lifts the great lid of a pithos, a storage jar like this one. The box came more than two thousand years later. In 1508, the scholar Erasmus wrote pyxis, a small box, and the word stuck.",
